{"v":4,"catch":"Nikoli的原創謎題，只用黑白兩色的圓圈做提示。","desc":"在這個原創的謎題中，你不會用到任何字母或數字--唯一的提示是黑色圓圈和白色圓圈。 \"Masyu \"是一道謎題，你要根據規則在空格中畫出一條線。了解了黑色和白色圓圈的屬性，你就能很快地玩起來了。可以畫線的圖案比你想像的要多，發現戰術動作也很有趣。\n\n選項菜單、手冊和其他文字都有日語、英語、法語、德語、意大利語和西班牙語版本。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-03-09","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","訓練","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/540a319a9519aaeb2c8d0121c8069e55f5a12571bdcca319d073d535d0ddccac.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/abc4c8833036da169560d896cb81325aad3bfb7d7b9e85c40cceea8116a12f66.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e44e5dc50e3a3038437fc57dd532e661fdac43de93929acc542bdb8738aa4b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cc3d1ae530b4dbe47477449c034403880cc157c0e654fb9e9659742114abcb6a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b3b94cf84bc31e3e055c8db2be9ab92d578ae2828361cb987818724c122a69df.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/97ca00512dcb75c443517404e54bdc4a88c59e90a47e62a05d3cb0d68d0eefd3.jpg"],"titleId":"010051200e98c000","dlc":[]}